18:28.808 --> 18:32.567
you know, this section is just kind of the purpose statement explaining

18:32.680 --> 18:36.423
why we're— what the purpose of this new chapter is.

18:37.162 --> 18:40.375
And then applicability, it's telling you that

18:40.953 --> 18:43.218
master development, MDPs,

18:44.391 --> 18:48.616
and preliminary plats are when residential uses Or

18:49.050 --> 18:53.083
when your residential waters come in and it's

18:53.583 --> 18:57.791
applicable, obviously. It's also telling you that these

