19:11.372 --> 19:25.468
Should probably have grabbed my— actually, I'm going to grab my So

19:25.968 --> 19:29.232
determination of water rights, I kind of explained this. This is the process when

19:30.137 --> 19:33.271
a new permit comes in and then the city engineer goes,

19:34.030 --> 19:37.750
gets 10 days to look at the— look at how

19:37.766 --> 19:41.097
much water is needed for use. Brandon, can I ask a question

