51:46.354 --> 51:49.341
to be dedicated or something to that effect? Yeah. Is that what you're suggesting?

51:49.798 --> 51:52.836
I think that does make a lot of sense to— Kind of tweak the language

51:53.336 --> 51:56.917
that way to clarify what's required. Yeah, because it's

51:57.417 --> 52:01.255
saying at the master development plan stage, not through it, but at.

52:01.431 --> 52:05.071
I mean, I'd just be a little more precise with that language. Yeah.

52:05.215 --> 52:08.404
