01:12:34.392 --> 01:12:38.201
They just— we basically decided just to come back

01:12:38.701 --> 01:12:42.749
here and just— we

01:12:43.249 --> 01:12:46.755
knew that there were limitations on what we could do with this. So that's what

01:12:47.255 --> 01:12:50.647
